units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008 origin 0.0 0.0 0.0
region whole block 0 20 0 20 0 63 units lattice
create_box 2 whole
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile
region target block 0 20 0 20 23 63 units lattice
create_atoms 2 region target
mass 1 92.90638
mass 2 92.90638
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb Nb
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 100000
group projectile region projectile
group target region target
velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 20.0 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
dump 1 all custom 1000 dump.spall.* id type x y z vx vy vz
run 100000
